From 3fab24bf218c5d1c66fcd10eeb8e39e21c0528ac Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: JeremiahBarkman <119763642+JeremiahBarkman@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 22 Jul 2026 13:39:28 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Aura integration: TCP frame client and shared-memory frame
 source

Consume frames from AuraFrameBridge (127.0.0.1:5151) instead of the
upstream sample's synthetic frame generator.

Adds TcpFrameClient and AuraSharedMemory; rewires FrameGenerator to
render Aura frames.

Based on upstream smourier/VCamSample @ ae42a88.
